<title>USA: WesterFed ups quarterly, sets special.</title>
<headline>WesterFed ups quarterly, sets special.</headline>
<dateline>MISSOULA, Mont. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>WesterFed Financial Corp said Friday it raised itsd quarterly dividend to $0.11 per share from $0.105 and declared a special dividend of $0.041 per share.</p>
<p>The company said the special dividend reflects a 10 percent addition to the $0.41 per share in dividends declared during the fiscal year just ended.</p>
<p>The total of $0.151 in dividends per share will be payable on August 20 to stockholders of record on August 6.</p>
</text>
